Benjamin Netanyahu ameaçou novas retiradas da população de Gaza caso esta não cessasse o lançamento de "papagaios, drones e balões"

## Summary
The European Union (UE) urged Israel to curb the 'atrocious' rhetoric of Itamar Ben-Gvir, while Benjamin Netanyahu threatened new evacuations in Gaza if attacks via 'kites, drones, and balloons' cease.

## Key Points
- UE criticizes Itamar Ben-Gvir's rhetoric as 'atrocious'
- Benjamin Netanyahu threatens Gaza with evacuations if aerial attacks continue
- Aerial attacks from Gaza include kites, drones, and balloons


